4312e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Dagger\"><img alt=\"Assassin Dagger\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Assassin_Dagger_b6ccb5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Traditional%20Sai\"><img alt=\"Traditional Sai\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Traditional_Sai_cccc75.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shadow Sceptre\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shadow_Sceptre_beffec.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.30<br/>December 11, 2013<br/>Winter Update 2013</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 303px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frame\"> <img alt=\"Roshamuul with labels.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"347\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Roshamuul_Legend_a9fc88.png\" width=\"303\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Roshamuul with labels.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Lower Roshamuul</b> hunting grounds are all areas between <a href=\"#/wiki/Inquisition\">Inquisition</a> base camp and the bridge. It is accessible immediately after going up the ramp from the camp. This area is small but open and extends west and east from the ramps. To the east are more ramps that go down to the ground floor level which is mountainous and has access to some strange underground caves. \nOnce the <a href=\"#/quest/roshamuul-quest\">bridge is repaired</a> it leads to <a href=\"#/wiki/Guzzlemaw%20Valley\">Guzzlemaw Valley</a> then to <a href=\"#/wiki/Upper%20Roshamuul\">Upper Roshamuul</a> (see each <a href=\"#/wiki/Game%20Worlds\">Game World</a> for its current stage).<br/>\nThis area is dangerous so a suggested level is 200.\n</p><p>The ground floor area can be crowded so utilise the caves and note that they do not always exit where you entered.\nOne underground cave has Lava Holes which attack you. Enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Instable%20Vortex\">Instable Vortex</a> at the far left end to escape. <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Instable Vortex\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Instable_Vortex_f689c2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shock%20Head\"><img alt=\"Shock Head\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shock_Head_506b56.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Shock%20Head\">Shock Head</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">950</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-200× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Frazzlemaw\"><img alt=\"Frazzlemaw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Frazzlemaw_583ac6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Frazzlemaw\">Frazzlemaw</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">3,740</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,300+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-100× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Frazzle Skin (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Frazzle Tongue (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Brown Crystal Splinter (uncommon)</li